The Keeper of Chains is a hulking, skull-faced figure in robes, a general in [[Sigzil Haight]]'s service. When the Scale delvers freed the [[Voice of Many]], Sigzil sent the Keeper, the nearest general who could reach the chamber fastest. He kicked down the door and fought the delvers, who bloodied him before the Voice of Many's restored magic blew him out of the room. He was not killed.

He wields a flaming greataxe, and he pointed a finger at the Voice of Many and spoke a killing word, which the delvers interrupted before it could land.
